### FraudGuard API examples. Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and IntelliJ's HTTP client.
### Values come from your .env (see .env.example). Replace the variables below, or use an http-client.env.json.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = demo-ingest-key
@username = analyst
@password = demo-analyst-password
@adminUser = admin
@adminPassword = demo-admin-password

### 1. Log in as an analyst. Copy "accessToken" from the answer into @token below (5 attempts per minute per IP).
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "{{username}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@token = paste-the-accessToken-here

### 2. Who am I?
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Ingest a transaction (a service API key, not a login). 202 = new, 200 = replay of the same Idempotency-Key.
POST {{base}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: example-0001

{
  "accountId": "acc-demo-1",
  "merchantId": "m-1",
  "transactionType": "PAYMENT",
  "amount": 25.50,
  "currency": "INR",
  "country": "IN",
  "deviceId": "dev-1"
}

### 4. Search: transactions waiting for an analyst
GET {{base}}/api/transactions?status=REVIEW&status=BLOCKED&reviewState=UNREVIEWED&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Counts for the dashboard header
GET {{base}}/api/transactions/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. One transaction with its decision inputs and review history (put a real id from step 4)
GET {{base}}/api/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Review it. The reviewer is the logged-in user, a "reviewer" field in the body is ignored.
POST {{base}}/api/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/review
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "action": "REQUEST_FURTHER_REVIEW", "note": "Need the device history" }

### 8. Feedback loop: label counts, models in use, live model
GET {{base}}/api/feedback/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/feedback/models
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/feedback/registry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---- ADMIN only: log in as admin, put that token in @token, then: ----

### 9. Training data export
GET {{base}}/api/feedback/labels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Dead-letter topic: how many records, and why they failed
GET {{base}}/api/admin/dlq/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Re-queue transactions stuck in PENDING for over 2 minutes
POST {{base}}/api/admin/transactions/redrive-pending?olderThanSeconds=120&limit=500
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health and metrics. Health is public; metrics need the METRICS login (HTTP Basic).
GET {{base}}/actuator/health/readiness

###
GET {{base}}/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: Basic cHJvbWV0aGV1czpkZW1vLW1ldHJpY3MtcGFzc3dvcmQ=
